      "text": "func flip() -> void:\n\tif _flipping or _meters.ended:\n\t\treturn\n\t_flipping = true\n\tis_inverted = not is_inverted\n\n\tworld_flipped.emit(is_inverted)\n\t_audio.play(\"flip\")"
